model g10_firsts
  tally 2
  on 2026-02-15
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-03-31
  note "T, issue #41, G10: a place's first reading as a cut sees it (L §8.1 HOLE-ANCHOR, E §4.3 step 1): late lives before the run with no opening; its reading on 11 February is known on the 13th, the one on the 12th since January; a projection from the 10th, whose cut sees only the later reading, asks of the 11th, and so does the main walk."

source fixture "T's fixture for S's kernel tests (invented values)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place late: accounts PLN lives 2025-06-01..

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

ask q_first: bal(late, 2026-02-11) from 2026-02-10, bal(late, 2026-02-10), bal(late, 2026-02-11), bal(late, 2026-02-12) law cut

version openings
  cite fixture
  governs always
  known 2025-12-31
  opening[konto] = 100 at 2026-01-01 start

version early_v
  cite fixture
  governs always
  known 2026-01-05
  anchor late
  stated[late] = 50.00 at 2026-02-12 end "the reading known since January"

version late_v
  cite fixture
  governs always
  known 2026-02-13
  anchor late
  stated[late] = 40.00 at 2026-02-11 end "an earlier reading, known only on the 13th"
